[node name="RulesDialog" type="AcceptDialog" parent="."]
title = "How to Play"
initial_position = 1

[node name="RulesScroll" type="ScrollContainer" parent="RulesDialog"]
custom_minimum_size = Vector2(660, 430)
layout_mode = 2
horizontal_scroll_mode = 0

[node name="RulesText" type="RichTextLabel" parent="RulesDialog/RulesScroll"]
custom_minimum_size = Vector2(630, 760)
layout_mode = 2
bbcode_enabled = true
fit_content = true
text = "[font_size=24][b]Map[/b][/font_size]\nThe battlefield is a radius-8 hex grid around a central Objective. Field costs 1 movement, Forest costs 2, Mountain costs 5, and Water requires water-crossing capability.\n\n[font_size=24][b]Setup[/b][/font_size]\nTwo or three players deploy units in their own deployment zones. Each player begins with 12 essence and may save unspent essence.\n\n[font_size=24][b]Turn Phases[/b][/font_size]\n1. Start Turn\n2. Marshal Troops\n3. Movement\n4. Combat\n5. Resolve\n6. Clean Up\n\n[font_size=24][b]Essence[/b][/font_size]\nAt the start of a turn, each active unit type generates half its cost once, regardless of duplicates. Battlefield Scavengers instead gain essence from units destroyed since their controller's previous turn. Essence buys units and upgrades.\n\n[font_size=24][b]Objective[/b][/font_size]\nGaining the Objective token grants 6 essence. Keeping it costs 3 essence at the end of each turn; failure to pay removes the token. Hold the Objective for 3 consecutive turns to win.\n\n[font_size=24][b]Victory[/b][/font_size]\nWin by eliminating all opposing units or controlling the Objective for 3 consecutive turns."
